# Shield Credit Card Fraud Detection Using ML

## About the Project

Shield Credit Card Fraud Detection is a Machine Learning-based web application designed to detect potentially fraudulent credit card transactions.

The system uses Machine Learning algorithms to analyze transaction details and predict whether a transaction is legitimate or fraudulent.

## Technologies Used

* Python
* Flask
* Flask-CORS
* Scikit-learn
* NumPy
* Pandas
* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript

## Features

* Credit card transaction fraud detection
* Machine Learning model prediction
* User-friendly web interface
* Backend API using Flask
* Automatic model training

## How to Run

### Backend

```bash
cd backend
python -m pip install -r requirements.txt
python app.py
```

The backend will run at:

http://127.0.0.1:5000

### Frontend

Open `frontend/index.html` in a browser or use VS Code Live Server.

## Project Objective

The main objective of this project is to identify fraudulent credit card transactions using Machine Learning techniques and improve digital payment security.

